OL,3,GNEWSASex offender ran into sea to
OL,4,Aescape officers during arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sex offender who ran into the sea to
OL,7,Fescape being arrested has been jailed,
OL,8,FSouth Wales Police has said.
OL,10,FGavin Bennett, 45, ran into the water
OL,11,Foff Porthcawl, Bridgend County, at
OL,12,Fnight after sending inappropriate
OL,13,Fmessages to a girl he believed to be
OL,14,Funder 16.
OL,16,FIn a video, two officers are seen
OL,17,Fwading into the Bristol Channel with
OL,18,Ftorches at about 21:45 on 22 October
OL,19,F2025 and pulling Bennett out.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
